## How to Use This Code

1. Copy the entire HTML code above
2. Create a new file with a .html extension (e.g., `zamil-video-generator.html`)
3. Paste the code into the file and save it
4. Open the file in any modern web browser

The page includes:
- A visual storyboard preview of all 5 frames from your specification
- Options to customize the video output
- A generate button that simulates the video creation process
- A progress bar and status messages
- A success message when the "generation" is complete

Note: This is a front-end simulation. In a real application, this would connect to a backend video generation service.
